        ANALYSIS --> MEMO
        PRICE --> MEMO
        ANALYSIS <--> API
        RANK <--> API
        PRICE <--> API
        MEMO --> API
    end

    subgraph F["05 · WEB APPLICATION"]
        direction TB
        UI["🖥️ Next.js · React · MapLibre GL<br/>3D Map · Quality Heatmap · Search<br/>Preferences · Ranked Locations<br/>Location Details · Appraisal · Memo"]
